        <Summary xml:lang="en">Mount and unmount filesystems from the Xfce panel</Summary>
        <Description xml:lang="en">The Xfce Mount Plugin allows users to mount and unmount filesystems from the panel, including devices and network filesystems listed in /etc/fstab. It displays mount status and filesystem usage, and supports configurable commands for mounting, unmounting, and opening mounted devices.
</Description>
